{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t第五屆亞殘運傍晚舉行閉幕禮。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n在閉幕禮的國家及地區旗幟進場儀式上，中國香港代表團由女子殘疾人劍擊代表湯雅婷擔任持旗手進場。在閉幕禮上，愛知名古屋大會將亞洲殘疾人奧委會旗幟交予下屆賽事主辦城市多哈。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n中國香港代表團今屆共奪得3金14銀24銅，共41面獎牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:02:25.958165+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:35:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:59.553884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:58:24.458649+00:00","content_hash":"429fc7ec1893c1f961ee15525955145b9dee4340a3aeee2ea49e04ec9992b488","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}